<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/0111cdf2bf4c> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "It took mere hours for the Internet to transform Tay, the teenage AI bot who wants to chat with and learn from millennials, into Tay, the racist and genocidal AI bot who liked to reference Hitler." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "793" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/0a56cc738d77> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Tay's successor is called Zo and is only available by invitation on messaging app Kik." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "9580" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/0ada07f96c11> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[5291] Tay was built by the Microsoft Technology and Research and Bing teams as a way to conduct research on conversational understanding." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "5291" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/0c8e39c3dee9> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[786] The chatbot, which was created by Microsoft’s Research department..." ;
