<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/0e63938f77e4> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[789] ...provided to the world at large via the messaging platforms Twitter, Kik and GroupMe." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "789" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/0f3163bc9183> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "In fact, before the creation of Tay, Microsoft developed and released an AI chatbot XiaoIce on China’s most widespread instant messaging application Wechat." ;
