<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/5179e167ab9e> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The chatbot, which was created by Microsoft’s Research department, greeted the day with an excited tweet that could have come from any teen." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "786" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/eeb3c5ddecfa> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Tay was built by the Microsoft Technology and Research and Bing teams as a way to conduct research on conversational understanding." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "5291" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/56a19659f976> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Louis Rosenberg, the founder of Unanimous AI, said that \"like all chat bots, Tay has no idea what it's saying...it has no idea if it's saying something offensive, or nonsensical, or profound." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "801" .

